# IRMarket Frontend — Environment

Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and set the deployed addresses. These are required by
`src/lib/wagmi.ts` and `src/lib/market.ts` once the frontend connects to contracts.

```
NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC_URL=https://testnet-rpc.monad.xyz
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAIN_ID=10143
NEXT_PUBLIC_MARKET_ADDRESS=0x...
# MonoracleWindowed — IRMarket-deployed fork (per-quote expiryBlock window, D-13).
# NOT the upstream Monoracle testnet deployment (its window is fixed 2 slots).
NEXT_PUBLIC_ORACLE_ADDRESS=0x...
# Upstream Monoracle live testnet deployment (informational only):
#   0x1ABABc60Ca6950C94eA80F2f611AB06aAAAD28c0
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_TOKEN=0x...
NEXT_PUBLIC_QUOTE_TOKEN=0x...
# IRMarketVault (LP-pool MVP) address from deployment-vault.json (repo root).
# Monad testnet deployment (informational):
#   0x8412c4DeDdE1992179aD6D6D8680b35b68b891D7
NEXT_PUBLIC_VAULT_ADDRESS=0x...
```